flowchart TB
  U[Internet users] --> DNS[GoDaddy root DNS\ndelegates dr.vaultrix.in]
  DNS --> R53[Route 53 shared hosted zone\nmanual approved failover]

  subgraph P[Primary ap-south-1]
    PVPC[10.10.0.0/16 VPC\n2-AZ subnet capacity]
    EALB[EKS ALB] --> EKS[EKS application]
    EKS --> PG[PostgreSQL StatefulSet\nEBS gp3]
    CALB[EC2 ALB] --> EC2[EC2 / ASG]
    EC2 --> RDS[RDS PostgreSQL]
    PVPC --- EALB
    PVPC --- CALB
  end

  R53 --> EALB
  R53 --> CALB

  subgraph B[Cross-Region recovery data]
    S3[S3: Velero metadata and pgBackRest]
    SNAP[Copied AMIs / EBS and RDS snapshots]
  end
  PG --> S3
  EKS --> S3
  EC2 --> SNAP
  RDS --> SNAP

  subgraph D[DR ap-southeast-1 - normally pilot light]
    DVPC[10.20.0.0/16 VPC\n2-AZ subnet capacity]
    DCOMP[On-demand EKS / EC2 / RDS / ALBs]
    DVPC --- DCOMP
  end
  S3 --> DCOMP
  SNAP --> DCOMP
  DCOMP -. after restore, tests, approval .-> R53

